  - m_Id: 48022144802816
    m_Localized: The critic is coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48047621005312
    m_Localized: Today, during the day, a critic will visit your cafe. He doesn't
      look any different from a regular customer, but if you serve him successfully,
      you can reach a new level of popularity. In case of failure, you will lose
      a significant amount of experience. Keep in mind that the critic will come
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48065874616320
    m_Localized: You served the critic!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48083239034880
    m_Localized: For this, you have reached a new level of popularity!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48112599162880
    m_Localized: You did not serve the critic!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48157637599232
    m_Localized: Because of this, you lost a lot of experience! But don't worry,
      as soon as you regain the lost experience, the critic will come again and you
      will have another chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
